{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 68,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "68:1",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "Nūn. By the pen and what they inscribe,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:2",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "You are not, [O Muḥammad], by the favor of your Lord, a madman.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:3",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "And indeed, for you is a reward uninterrupted.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:4",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "And indeed, you are of a great moral character.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:5",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "So you will see and they will see",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:6",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "Which of you is the afflicted [by a devil].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:7",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who has gone astray from His way, and He is most knowing of the [rightly] guided.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:8",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "Then do not obey the deniers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:9",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "They wish that you would soften [in your position], so they would soften [toward you].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:10",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "And do not obey every worthless habitual swearer",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:11",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "[And] scorner, going about with malicious gossip -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:12",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "A preventer of good, transgressing and sinful,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:13",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "Cruel, moreover, and an illegitimate pretender.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:14",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "Because he is a possessor of wealth and children,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:15",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:16",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "We will brand him upon the snout.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:17",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "Indeed, We have tried them as We tried the companions of the garden, when they swore to cut its fruit in the [early] morning",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:18",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "Without making exception.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:19",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "So there came upon it [i.e., the garden] an affliction from your Lord while they were asleep.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:20",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "And it became as though reaped.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:21",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "And they called one another at morning,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:22",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "[Saying], \"Go early to your crop if you would cut the fruit.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:23",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "So they set out, while lowering their voices,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:24",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "[Saying], \"There will surely not enter it today upon you [any] poor person.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:25",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "And they went early in determination, [assuming themselves] able.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:26",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "But when they saw it, they said, \"Indeed, we are lost;",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:27",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "Rather, we have been deprived.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:28",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "The most moderate of them said, \"Did I not say to you, 'Why do you not exalt [Allāh]?'\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:29",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "They said, \"Exalted is our Lord! Indeed, we were wrongdoers.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:30",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 30,
      "text": "Then they approached one another, blaming each other.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:31",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 31,
      "text": "They said, \"O woe to us; indeed we were transgressors.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:32",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 32,
      "text": "Perhaps our Lord will substitute for us [one] better than it. Indeed, we are toward our Lord desirous.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:33",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 33,
      "text": "Such is the punishment [of this world]. And the punishment of the Hereafter is greater, if they only knew.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:34",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 34,
      "text": "Indeed, for the righteous with their Lord are the Gardens of Pleasure.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:35",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 35,
      "text": "Then will We treat the Muslims like the criminals?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:36",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 36,
      "text": "What is [the matter] with you? How do you judge?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:37",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 37,
      "text": "Or do you have a scripture in which you learn",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:38",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 38,
      "text": "That indeed for you is whatever you choose?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:39",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 39,
      "text": "Or do you have oaths [binding] upon Us, extending until the Day of Resurrection, that indeed for you is whatever you judge?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:40",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 40,
      "text": "Ask them which of them, for that [claim], is responsible.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:41",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 41,
      "text": "Or do they have partners? Then let them bring their partners, if they should be truthful.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:42",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 42,
      "text": "The Day the shin will be uncovered and they are invited to prostration but they [i.e., the disbelievers] will not be able,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:43",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 43,
      "text": "Their eyes humbled, humiliation will cover them. And they used to be invited to prostration while they were sound.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:44",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 44,
      "text": "So leave Me, [O Muḥammad], with [the matter of] whoever denies this statement [i.e., the Qur’ān]. We will progressively lead them [to punishment] from where they do not know.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:45",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 45,
      "text": "And I will give them time. Indeed, My plan is firm.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:46",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 46,
      "text": "Or do you ask of them a payment, so they are by debt burdened down?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:47",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 47,
      "text": "Or have they [knowledge of] the unseen, so they write [it] down?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:48",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 48,
      "text": "Then be patient for the decision of your Lord, [O Muḥammad], and be not like the companion of the fish [i.e., Jonah] when he called out while he was distressed.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:49",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 49,
      "text": "If not that a favor [i.e., mercy] from his Lord overtook him, he would have been thrown onto the naked shore while he was censured.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:50",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 50,
      "text": "And his Lord chose him and made him of the righteous.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:51",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 51,
      "text": "And indeed, those who disbelieve would almost make you slip with their eyes [i.e., looks] when they hear the message, and they say, \"Indeed, he is mad.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "68:52",
      "surahNumber": 68,
      "ayahNumber": 52,
      "text": "But it is not except a reminder to the worlds.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
